-- Type inference (D007/D072): a sig-less LAMBDA definition. Lambdas are
-- introduction forms (check-mode only in the bidirectional kernel), so
-- `addOne` cannot synthesize — the oracle infers the ground principal
-- type `Int -> Int` (the `+` pins the metavariable) and the verified
-- elaborator re-checks the body against it.
--
-- Expected: exit code 5

import I.Linux.Syscalls as S

addOne x = x + 1

main = exit@S (addOne 4)
